        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 7211, Brass Spring Door Pivot Hinge Box Clamp Jamb Mounted</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer Industries has been in business since 1876, with over 125 years of quality products. Their products are American made with American metals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer 7211 Spring Door Pivot Hinge, Surface Mounted on door and Box Clamp Mounted on door jamb. Cast Brass construction pivot hinge for doors up to 30 Inches Wide, 1-7/8 Inches Thick with a Maximum Door Weight of 50 lbs. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bommer 7211 Brass door pivot hinges are typically used on <b>Bathroom Lavatory Doors</b> or gate doors. Fits either 1-1/8\" or 1-1/4\" Thick Door Jambs only.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/satin-chrome-surface-mount-spring-door-pivot-hinge-with-non-adjustable-tension-bommer-7212-626\"><b>Bommer 7212</b></a> Surface Mount Spring Door Pivot Hinge.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bommer 7211 Spring Pivot:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Width: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Thickness: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight :50 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Brass Construction</li>\r\n<li>Surface Mounted on Door</li>\r\n<li>Box Clamp Mounted on Door Jamb</li>\r\n<li>Double Acting</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Swing: 130º each direction</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Non-Adjustable Spring Tension</li>\r\n<li>Flat Door Bracket: For doors not less than 3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Box Clamp Jamb Bracket for 1-1/8\" or 1-1/4\" Wide Jambs</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with #12 - 1-1/4\",  #10 - 1\" Flat Head Wood Screws and Thru-Bolts for Jamb Bracket</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7211.pdf?v=1691094995\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 7211 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSold individually as a set, with 1 pivot , 1 each jamb and door bracket, 1 top pivot assembly with jamb bracket, and mounting screw hardware. Enough to do one door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b><font size=\"+2\">This Item is Discontinued<br>0 in stock</font></b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n\r\n</p>",
